  unitName: Weeping Ice Camilla
  unitId: 20946
  unitNumber: 1547
  description: A female thief belonging to the Ten Vile Disnomians, a group once
    known to have operated at the dawn of the Empire. Camilla's band of thieves focused
    their activities on the territories surrounding the Empire until they were eventually
    wiped out by a strike from the Imperial Guard. It was then that the leader of
    the Disnomians came to Camilla's rescue, resulting in her eventual enlistment
    as a permanent member of the group. Although using her comrades to achieve her
    own ends originally earned her quite a deal of mistrust from the other members,
    her ability to gather intelligence proved to be invaluable. Rumor has it that
    it was Camilla who provided the leader of the Disnomians with information of
    the man behind the emperor's murder.
  summonDesc: Wow, you managed to summon me.<br>Well, just know that I don't work
    for free. I'll need something substantial in return.
  fusionDesc: That's all you're gonna give me?<br>You've gotta be kidding me.<br>I'll
    still take it though.
